/* Gn082 - ShapeUpgrade_ConvertSurfaceToBezierBasis multi-patch seam drift
   Defect: B-spline surface with multiple interior knots in both U and V;
   conversion produces N×M grid of Bezier patches but neighbor seams have
   tolerance drift. */
